<title>SPAIN: Rato says EU report confirms Spain's EMU entry - EFE.</title>
<headline>Rato says EU report confirms Spain's EMU entry - EFE.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Wednesday that a European Commission report due out today confirms that Spain qualifies for the European economic and monetary union, Spain's EFE news agency reported.</p>
<p>Speaking on his way into the senate, Rato said the EC forecasts consolidate Spain as a stable nation, and this stability will allow it to &quot;attract investment and along with that the possibility of creating employment and prosperity.&quot;</p>
<p>The EC forecasts provide &quot;one more confirmation that economic policy is going in the right direction,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
